<RequirementSet xmlns:sysml="http://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20181001/CoolingRAG/Requirements" setId="ER-P090" sourceRequirementId="P090" stakeholder="材料工程师" generationBasis="original_requirement_and_supported_evidence_only" generatedAt="2026-05-27T01:30:52">
  <ProfessionalSummary>覆盖封闭式冷却水系统加热器换热管材料选择要求，防止电偶腐蚀和应力腐蚀开裂。</ProfessionalSummary>
  <EngineeringRequirements count="1">
    <Requirement id="ER-P090-01" level="1" requirementType="material">
      <sysml:Name>加热器换热管材料选择</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>封闭式冷却水系统的加热器换热管应选用铜镍合金或钛材，以防止因电偶腐蚀或应力腐蚀开裂导致泄漏。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="review" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P090" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-SYS-WATER-008" supportStatus="supported_by_indirect_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>supported_by_indirect_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>使用不当材料可能导致电偶腐蚀或应力腐蚀开裂，造成冷却水泄漏，影响主机运行安全。</RiskIfUnmet>
        <ApplicabilityConstraint>本条需求基于 MTU 发动机手册证据，适用范围限于该厂家机型，其他厂家和机型应按各自 Technical Data 确认。</ApplicabilityConstraint>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查加热器换热管材料证书，确认材质为铜镍合金或钛材。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>设计图纸中应明确标注换热管材料牌号。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【加热器换热管材料选择】，来自原始需求「选用铜镍合金或钛材，防止因电偶腐蚀或应力腐蚀开裂导致泄漏」。E-SYS-WATER-008 支撑了冷却水回路中禁止使用铜、锌、黄铜及镀锌表面以防止电偶腐蚀的要求，间接支撑了选用铜镍合金或钛材的合理性。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
